# Two independent counts n, m and two dimensions d, e in one diagram: the Fourier
# superposition on n registers of dimension d and m of dimension e [nielsen2010quantum,
# section 5.1]. Target: the uniform state on every register, scaled d^(-n/2) e^(-m/2).

@rhs =
    count n, m
    repeat n: Z(0 -> 1, d)
    repeat m: Z(0 -> 1, e)
    scalar d^(-n/2) * e^(-m/2)

load
    count n, m
    repeat n: X(0 -> 1, d) -> F(d)
    repeat m: X(0 -> 1, e) -> F(e)
    scalar d^(-n/2) * e^(-m/2)

decide against @rhs
